  "description": "Notification Messaging SDK is a robust, extensible, and production-ready library for sending notifications (Email, SMS, Slack, and more) in .NET applications. It provides unified abstractions, provider-agnostic interfaces, template support, and advanced configuration for modern notification workflows.",
  "id": "Service.Notification.Messaging",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2025-07-08T15:13:36.287Z",
